e Silent Aim - Locks your shots onto zombies automatically\nClosest Zombie Mode - Ignores FOV, aims at absolute closest zombie even behind you\nWall Check - Only aims at zombies visible (not through walls)\nShow FOV Circle - Displays the FOV circle on screen\nFOV Radius - Adjustable FOV size (50-800)\nZombie Chams - Rainbow highlight on all zombies (see through walls)\nFreeze Zombies - Expands zombie hitboxes making them stuck/frozen\n\nAuto Farm\nAuto Farm (Sky) - Teleports to sky, stays locked, auto kills all zombies with bullet TP, returns to original position when disabled\nBullet TP - Bullets teleport to zombies while you play normally (no sky teleport)\n\nGun Mods\nNo Recoil - Removes gun recoil, spread, kickback, and camera shake\nNo Fire Rate Limit - Removes fire rate limit for faster shooting\n\nMelee\nMelee Kill Aura - Auto attacks zombies with melee weapon (requires melee equipped)\nAttack Speed - Adjustable attack speed (0.1-1.0)\n\nTools\nEquip All Guns - Equips all guns from backpack\nEquip All Melee - Equips all melee weapons from backpack\nEquip All Tools - Equips everything from backpack\n\n\n\nMISC TAB\nMovement\nFly - CFrame fly with WASD + Space/Ctrl controls\nFly Speed - Adjustable fly speed (10-200)\nWalkSpeed - Custom walk speed\nSpeed - Adjustable walk speed value (16-200)\nInfinite Jump - Jump unlimited times in the air\nNoclip - Walk through walls and objects\n\nSafety\nAnti Death - Teleports to sky when HP is low, returns to saved position when healed\nTrigger HP - Health threshold to trigger safety teleport (10-50)\nResume HP - Health needed to return from safety (50-100)\nLava Bypass - Blocks lava damage and teleports random if touching lava, made this for a different auto farm but i removed that","tags":["bloxfruits"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/J4VKc2qHvD","keyLink":"https://getpolsec.com/ad/f314c1ee907e78b4f2abbac6c4879f832aff97d4e791da6dd438b9bbaa3c99ff","owner":{"_id":"689e11538941f7a4010249df","username":"Azrixs","verified":false